      "body": "Yup: I pinged them with\r\n\r\n> have the runners changed recently? We are seeing failures across the board like this: https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/actions/runs/32006372751/job/95316581495?pr=35991\r\n>\r\n> where we cannot set up our ipv6 docker network. Looks to me like the runner lacks the per-bridge IPv6 sysctl from\r\n\r\n```\r\nopen /proc/sys/net/ipv6/conf/br-.../disable_ipv6:\r\nno such file or directory\r\n```",
